msgstr "低速行駛時降低轉向扭矩，以避免 EPS 鎖定。"

msgid "Restores stop-and-go behavior on VAG A0 platform vehicles (Polo, Fabia, Ibiza, etc.), allowing openpilot to resume from a full stop without driver intervention."
msgstr "恢復 VAG A0 平台車輛（Polo、Fabia、Ibiza 等）的走走停停功能，讓 openpilot 從完全停止狀態恢復行駛，而無需駕駛干預。"
msgid ""
"Force openpilot to go into onroad/offroad state.<br>(e.g. for update purpose)"
msgstr "強制 openpilot 切換上線/離線狀態。<br>（例如：用於更新）"
#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/firehose.py:17
msgid ""
"For maximum effectiveness, bring your device inside and connect to a good "
"USB-C adapter and Wi-Fi weekly.\n"
"\n"
"Firehose Mode can also work while you're driving if connected to a hotspot "
"or unlimited SIM card.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Frequently Asked Questions\n"
"\n"
"Does it matter how or where I drive? Nope, just drive as you normally "
"would.\n"
"\n"
"Do all of my segments get pulled in Firehose Mode? No, we selectively pull a "
"subset of your segments.\n"
"\n"
"What's a good USB-C adapter? Any fast phone or laptop charger should be "
"fine.\n"
"\n"
"Does it matter which software I run? Yes, only upstream openpilot (and "
"particular forks) are able to be used for training."
msgstr ""
"為了達到最佳效果，請將設備帶到室內，每週連接優質 USB-C 充電器和 Wi-Fi。\n"
"\n"
"如果連接了熱點或不限量流量卡，在行車過程中也可使用 Firehose 模式。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"常見問題\n"
"\n"
"我的駕駛方式或駕駛地點有影響嗎？沒有，像平時一樣駕駛即可。\n"
"\n"
"在 Firehose 模式下，我的所有片段都會被拉取嗎？不會，我們會選擇性地拉取部分片段。\n"
"\n"
"什麼樣的 USB-C 充電器比較好？任何快充手機或筆記本充電器都可以。\n"
"\n"
"我運行什麼軟件有關係嗎？有，只有上游的 openpilot（及特定分支）可用於訓練。"

msgid "Adaptive Coasting Mode (ACM) reduces braking to allow smoother coasting when appropriate."
msgstr "自適應滑行模式 (ACM) 會在適當的時候減少制動，從而實現更平穩的滑行。"

msgid "Automatically switches personality to \"Aggressive\" below 30 km/h and restores your selected personality above 40 km/h."
msgstr "車速低於 30 公里/小時時，自動切換至‘激進’模式；車速高於 40 公里/小時時，恢復至您選擇的模式。"

msgid "Lead Dist"
msgstr "前車距離"

#: dragonpilot/settings/min-feat.lon.traffic-stop.py:8
#, python-format
msgid "Traffic Light / Stop Sign Stopping"
msgstr "紅綠燈／停止標誌自動停車"

#: dragonpilot/settings/min-feat.lon.traffic-stop.py:22
#, python-format
msgid "Traffic Stop Distance Adjust"
msgstr "停止距離微調"

#: dragonpilot/settings/min-feat.lon.traffic-stop.py:10
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Uses the driving model's own predicted path to detect an upcoming red light "
"or stop sign and brings the car to a smooth stop, without needing a "
"dedicated traffic-light recognition model.<br>Ported from the openpilot "
"carrot (cp) branch."
msgstr ""
"利用駕駛模型自己預測的行駛軌跡，偵測前方紅燈或停止標誌，讓車輛自然平順地煞"
"停，不需要額外的紅綠燈辨識模型。<br>移植自 openpilot carrot (cp) 分支。"
#: dragonpilot/settings/min-feat.lon.traffic-stop.py:32
#, python-format

msgid "m"
msgstr "公尺"

#: dragonpilot/settings/min-feat.lon.traffic-stop.py:24
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Fine-tune where the car stops relative to the detected stop line. Positive "
"values stop further back, negative values stop closer.<br>This is on top of "
"a fixed camera-to-bumper correction - start small and adjust based on your "
"own installation."
msgstr ""
"微調車輛相對於偵測到的停止線的停車位置。正值停更遠，負值停更近。<br>這是疊加"
"在固定的相機到車頭保桿修正值之上，建議從小數值開始並依自己的裝機情況調整。"